# Sair-Lean4: Formal Verification Template for Modified Loop Quantum Gravity & Cosmology

This repository provides a modular Lean 4 formalization template for verifying alternative geometric quantization schemes against standard Loop Quantum Gravity (LQG) and Loop Quantum Cosmology (LQC) foundations. 

Specifically, this template establishes the formal boilerplate to test whether an alternative discrete space-map architecture (such as the 12-valent dodecagonal `dod3` framework scaled by the golden ratio $\phi$) mathematically converges with, or departs from, standard published derivations (Ashtekar–Singh 2011, Rovelli–Vidotto 2014, Bekenstein 1973).

